Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.35,0:00:12.32,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.49,0:00:18.63,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.97,0:00:24.77,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:31.08,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.11,0:00:47.95,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:54.86,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:01:01.10,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.28,0:01:07.11,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.58,0:01:13.54,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.69,0:01:24.69,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.20,0:01:49.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,月亮妈妈好像快消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.47,0:01:52.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊！流星！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.94,0:01:58.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能一直和杀生丸少爷在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.74,0:01:59.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小玲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.48,0:02:02.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别慢吞吞的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.41,0:02:03.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:06.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇妙的气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.52,0:02:10.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶鬼们…在蠢蠢欲动什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.30,0:02:20.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天是朔日吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:25.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连月亮都有隐藏在黑暗之中的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.54,0:02:30.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被奈落掌握心脏的我 却无处可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.71,0:02:32.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.44,0:02:36.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落饲养的魑魅魍魉呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.02,0:02:41.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从结界里消失了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.12,0:02:50.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第66话 奈落的结界 神乐的决心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.07,0:02:59.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:01.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.65,0:03:06.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍微休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.52,0:03:09.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然身体会撑不住的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.95,0:03:12.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狼群们也上气不接下气了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.52,0:03:13.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.19,0:03:15.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 拿你们没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.03,0:03:17.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是配合你们的脚程
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.93,0:03:20.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花一百年也到不了奈落城吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.97,0:03:21.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.10,0:03:25.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只是胡乱的跑来跑去不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.24,0:03:27.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我闻到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.01,0:03:29.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一股令人作呕的妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.61,0:03:33.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落城已经很近了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.75,0:03:38.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一次一定要冲进去宰掉他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:04:02.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被他暗算杀害的同伴们的仇…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.31,0:04:04.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要报
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.25,0:04:11.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.02,0:04:13.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道不是这个方向吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.05,0:04:14.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.02,0:04:16.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要跟我说话 我会分心的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.19,0:04:20.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算嗅地面也无法知道奈落城在哪里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.09,0:04:24.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.90,0:04:25.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:28.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的鼻子是不是变的不灵敏啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.40,0:04:29.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚又是朔日耶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.97,0:04:33.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来 今天是新月呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.27,0:04:34.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朔日吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.71,0:04:35.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.97,0:04:38.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚是犬夜叉失去妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.21,0:04:40.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成人类姿态的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.48,0:04:43.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 今天不要太勉强了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.55,0:04:44.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算找到了奈落城
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:47.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有妖力的话也无法战斗呀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:48.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.92,0:04:50.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好不容易才到这来的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.92,0:04:54.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是不要太逞强比较…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.93,0:04:58.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…旋风？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.43,0:05:00.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愈来愈接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.14,0:05:07.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 戈薇 你也来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:09.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.07,0:05:12.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫你一直闻地面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.64,0:05:16.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大烂狗 你也是一路闻过来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.38,0:05:21.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘦皮狼…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.59,0:05:22.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.09,0:05:23.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.82,0:05:25.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.52,0:05:29.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙 你已经找到奈落城了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.59,0:05:32.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 虽然不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.90,0:05:35.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是四处散发着奈落那家伙令人作呕的臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.27,0:05:38.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前从来没有这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.10,0:05:38.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.34,0:05:41.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城的结界比较松散了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.97,0:05:43.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之追着这个臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.61,0:05:45.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能到达那家伙的城
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.04,0:05:47.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心吧 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.91,0:05:50.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会杀了奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.48,0:05:52.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你对我说也…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.05,0:05:54.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行啦 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.29,0:05:56.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要阻止我 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:05:59.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是今天 我要做个了断
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.12,0:06:00.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都说不要这样了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.69,0:06:03.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 大烂狗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:04.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.56,0:06:09.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那股令人不爽的狗臭味没了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:10.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是洗了澡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.37,0:06:11.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.14,0:06:14.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要靠近我的戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.21,0:06:16.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点分开 臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.14,0:06:18.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不甘心的话就分分看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:20.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶~ 等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.64,0:06:21.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.81,0:06:24.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算追上了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.72,0:06:27.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是做这些事的时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.38,0:06:28.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.82,0:06:31.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙 你想逃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.22,0:06:34.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的脑袋我要定了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.46,0:06:38.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下…钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.83,0:06:39.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好 戈薇大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.16,0:06:40.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.03,0:06:42.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思我们先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:46.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.67,0:06:48.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要追吗 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.34,0:06:50.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 今晚不要行动比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.11,0:06:53.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！别开玩笑了 会被抢先一步的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.61,0:06:56.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你冷静一点 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:06:57.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙姑且不论
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.68,0:07:00.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想对奈落暴露人类的姿态吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.35,0:07:02.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半妖失去妖力的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.49,0:07:04.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被知道的话可是攸关性命吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.69,0:07:05.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然对手是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.69,0:07:07.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要更加小心才是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.43,0:07:09.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.43,0:07:14.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偏偏在这奈落的臭味 四处飘散的关键时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.87,0:07:24.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.08,0:07:27.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座城真让人透不过气
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.51,0:07:31.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些跟着城被带来的家臣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.72,0:07:34.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也中了奈落结界的毒气
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.15,0:07:35.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部的人都死了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.46,0:07:40.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你啊 神无
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.72,0:07:42.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然站在我的身后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:48.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是叫做钢牙的妖狼族的少主
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:51.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经来到这座城附近了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.17,0:07:53.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偶然吗？还是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:56.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 神无
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.61,0:07:58.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落知道这件事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.11,0:08:01.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道…他不在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.05,0:08:05.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来 奈落那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.05,0:08:08.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候会不在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.25,0:08:09.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.26,0:08:13.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去杀了那小子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.56,0:08:16.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用不着等奈落的命令吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.49,0:08:18.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样好吗 神乐…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.56,0:08:21.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落那种拐弯抹角的作风
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.93,0:08:23.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我的个性不合
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.77,0:08:25.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,持有四魂碎片的家伙就杀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.77,0:08:27.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不需要什么步骤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.57,0:08:29.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都在奈落手上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.01,0:08:32.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论是生是死
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:36.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是奈落的道具
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.92,0:08:40.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管他的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:42.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在那家伙不在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.53,0:08:50.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现了好奇怪的浓雾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.79,0:08:52.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都看不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:54.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.03,0:08:57.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的臭味最浓
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.43,0:08:59.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该在这附近没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.67,0:09:02.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙 上面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:10.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骷髅跟刀？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.45,0:09:19.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 好久不见了嘛 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.19,0:09:20.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:26.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么搞的 那些骷髅…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.36,0:09:29.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些是城里的守卫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.70,0:09:31.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要多少就有多少
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.07,0:09:32.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风使神乐…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.07,0:09:34.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那张讨人厌的嘴脸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:36.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有一天忘掉过
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.71,0:09:40.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么说 你就是杀害我同伴的元凶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:42.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉悟吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.08,0:09:45.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个时候的帐我要全部讨回来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:47.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.58,0:09:50.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天没拿到你的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.49,0:09:52.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我要定了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.22,0:09:55.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要封住钢牙的速度太简单了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:09:57.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就跳支舞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:09:58.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尸舞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.37,0:10:06.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼！中看不重用
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.51,0:10:12.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风刃之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.51,0:10:13.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别傻了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:20.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.25,0:10:23.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打中了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.39,0:10:26.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 我要让你再也跑不了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.29,0:10:30.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙蛇之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.64,0:10:39.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.90,0:10:42.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骨骸的…漩涡？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.14,0:10:43.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.15,0:10:55.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任选一条路吧 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.15,0:10:59.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在漩涡中被骨骸削成肉片
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.82,0:11:02.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是跳出来被我剁碎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.93,0:11:04.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用哪种方式我都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.06,0:11:08.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样就是算钢牙也撑不住的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.67,0:11:10.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.93,0:11:13.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是凭我们的力量…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.18,0:11:22.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 那娘们一副悠哉的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.45,0:11:25.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是抢走操纵妖气的扇子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.48,0:11:26.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是就赢了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:28.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 还有这一招
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.99,0:11:30.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就偷偷的靠过去抢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:31.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.96,0:11:32.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.69,0:11:35.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋！还没靠近就会被她发现
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.36,0:11:37.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唏哩哗啦的被切碎的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.83,0:11:40.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是要抵抗神乐的风的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.97,0:11:44.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等！是风吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.37,0:11:45.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.84,0:11:47.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 银太
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.34,0:11:49.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别老是擅自行动啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.24,0:11:53.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的结界产生了松弛的情形
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.34,0:11:57.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照钢牙的行动来看应该没错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.12,0:12:00.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得就算只有城的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:02.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是去确认一下比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.39,0:12:05.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在又不能带犬夜叉去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:08.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由我和弥勒法师前往就好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.73,0:12:10.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果犬夜叉不听话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.13,0:12:12.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就用戈薇姑娘的“坐下”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.36,0:12:13.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,封住他的行动
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.63,0:12:15.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,揍他一顿让他安分点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.00,0:12:18.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又要用这一招啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.14,0:12:21.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.77,0:12:24.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙似乎对被称赞没有抵抗力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.51,0:12:25.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我想只要捧他一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.54,0:12:29.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就不会追问犬夜叉的味道的事了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.41,0:12:30.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.28,0:12:32.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不用对他抛媚眼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.55,0:12:35.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是对那只瘦皮狼太随便了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:37.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才没有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.65,0:12:38.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明明就有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.02,0:12:40.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:41.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.43,0:12:43.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.89,0:12:45.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那声音是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.26,0:12:47.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.90,0:12:49.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是钢牙的同伴们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.67,0:12:50.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 快躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:55.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.17,0:12:58.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族的人又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.28,0:13:00.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.18,0:13:04.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇大姐 不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.42,0:13:09.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙与神乐正在战斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.19,0:13:12.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之情况对钢牙有点不利
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.06,0:13:13.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.06,0:13:16.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这模样千万不能被看到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.79,0:13:18.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用担心啦 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.70,0:13:21.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我根本没义务要去救钢牙那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.43,0:13:24.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 既然神乐出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.84,0:13:27.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表示奈落城果然就在这附近
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.07,0:13:29.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落为了不让我们接近
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.84,0:13:32.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理应会仔细的布下结界…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.34,0:13:34.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人很在意
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.08,0:13:36.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只好去调查看看了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.08,0:13:38.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:41.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你和戈薇好好待着
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.99,0:13:44.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要将人类姿态保密吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.96,0:13:46.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.33,0:13:52.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:53.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呆子一个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.96,0:13:55.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听好了 你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.23,0:13:56.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敢把看到的事情说出去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.50,0:13:57.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就宰了你们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.60,0:14:00.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:02.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.51,0:14:04.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然都堵住了他们的嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.24,0:14:06.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.15,0:14:10.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风已经染上你的血腥味了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.52,0:14:14.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再让风转得更猛烈点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.85,0:14:19.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.49,0:14:21.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吓到不敢出来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.76,0:14:26.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是说…你已经死在里面了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:28.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:32.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论打碎多少骨头
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.77,0:14:33.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是解决不了问题
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.14,0:14:36.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来 要冲出这刀的漩涡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.77,0:14:38.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是我 身体也会挺不住
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.51,0:14:40.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么办…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.15,0:14:44.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多该让他出来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:45.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是真的被剁碎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:48.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找起四魂碎片可就辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.89,0:14:50.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会不会死用不着你操心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.56,0:14:55.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 从上面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.66,0:14:56.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.53,0:14:59.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还蛮顽强的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.66,0:15:00.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我想这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.90,0:15:01.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.67,0:15:11.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法动弹了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.31,0:15:12.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:13.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论用跑的用冲的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.41,0:15:15.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都不可能摆脱我的风的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.55,0:15:17.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风刃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.42,0:15:26.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.79,0:15:39.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.30,0:15:48.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.41,0:15:51.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,双脚的碎片我收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.18,0:15:54.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样你就只是普通的妖怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.21,0:15:58.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多该送你上路了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.68,0:16:00.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.82,0:16:06.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.73,0:16:15.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你捡回一条命了 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.47,0:16:21.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逃走了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.07,0:16:23.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 钢牙他…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:28.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.08,0:16:32.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,双脚的四魂碎片都被抢走了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.22,0:16:34.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.35,0:16:37.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好严重的伤 我马上帮你治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.99,0:16:39.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种死了也无所谓的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.46,0:16:40.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别理他了 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.22,0:16:42.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.73,0:16:46.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.26,0:16:49.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是没用啊 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.23,0:16:50.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然被区区的神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.13,0:16:51.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞的这么狼狈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.60,0:16:53.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才是咧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.97,0:16:56.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那什么弱不禁风的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:17:00.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早就在想 犬夜叉这家伙是不是半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.11,0:17:02.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.48,0:17:06.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据我听过的传闻
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.18,0:17:08.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半妖为了保住性命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.15,0:17:12.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成人类的时候 绝对不会让敌人看见的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:14.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的胆子真不小
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.09,0:17:18.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然敢以这种模样 在我面前出现
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.86,0:17:20.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:23.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然让你知道了秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:25.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想动手吗 臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.84,0:17:27.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.10,0:17:28.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就在这里送你上路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.41,0:17:32.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.58,0:17:35.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是从我的国度带来的药
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.15,0:17:38.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对撕裂伤很有效
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.08,0:17:40.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.75,0:17:44.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.66,0:17:49.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是活该
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.76,0:17:51.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:53.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是钢牙他们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.36,0:17:55.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连犬夜叉都来到城附近了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.17,0:18:01.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落的结界变的松散了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.23,0:18:04.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 现在奈落他…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.73,0:18:06.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不在！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.72,0:18:23.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是痛快
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.95,0:18:25.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.52,0:18:27.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不用把这些交给奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.26,0:18:30.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要逃的话只有趁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.42,0:18:33.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的结界变松散的现在
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.69,0:18:36.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是只怕奈落…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.63,0:18:40.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.94,0:18:48.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要忘了 神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.74,0:18:53.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的心脏随时都掌握在我奈落的手里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.95,0:18:55.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.68,0:19:00.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要让你变回原本的肉块是轻而易举的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.52,0:19:03.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐 你不要忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.72,0:19:05.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底不过是从我奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.99,0:19:08.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诞生的身体的一部分而已
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.26,0:19:11.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可别忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.83,0:19:15.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 不行 还是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.04,0:19:22.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我根本就无法逃出那家伙的掌握
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.78,0:19:29.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,流星…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.52,0:19:34.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有这个人不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.26,0:19:38.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.53,0:19:46.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若是那男人的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.07,0:19:53.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该拥有能切断 我与奈落之间障碍的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.82,0:20:15.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐…你想逃是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.77,0:20:23.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发光了 星星发光了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.30,0:20:26.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 你看…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.74,0:20:33.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得最近的杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.25,0:20:34.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是心里面充满
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.91,0:20:37.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连身为家臣的我都无法想象到的心事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.32,0:20:39.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好寂寞喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.89,0:20:41.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个小丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.32,0:20:42.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全不知道我的辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.86,0:20:44.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睡得这么甜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.89,0:20:47.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.66,0:20:50.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.33,0:20:53.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那家伙的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.10,0:20:57.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.04,0:21:01.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确是曾经冒犯杀生丸少爷您的骗子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.61,0:21:02.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.91,0:21:04.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么他在这附近吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.61,0:21:07.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这 这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.59,0:21:17.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.59,0:21:18.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还“嗨”咧 你不是？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.29,0:21:20.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.89,0:21:23.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是闻着奈落的味道而来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.13,0:21:25.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.80,0:21:28.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这女人…是奈落的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.80,0:21:31.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫作风使神乐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.97,0:21:36.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真高兴 你还记得我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.48,0:21:40.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手先放开剑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.81,0:21:42.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是来找你打架的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.15,0:21:46.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸 要不要和我交易
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.65,0:21:47.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交易？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.86,0:21:51.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是什么 你应该知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.72,0:21:55.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些四魂碎片 我可以给你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.93,0:21:59.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,条件是…把奈落杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.70,0:22:00.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:04.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我从那家伙的身边解脱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.98,0:22:21.41,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.95,0:22:28.41,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.73,0:22:34.93,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.40,0:22:41.43,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.74,0:22:48.20,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.48,0:22:55.21,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.72,0:23:02.15,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.46,0:23:09.06,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.20,0:23:15.73,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.94,0:23:22.47,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.81,0:23:29.24,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.49,0:23:36.08,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.27,0:23:49.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字是神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.84,0:23:52.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是风 自由自在的活着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.24,0:23:53.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要背叛吗 神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.81,0:23:54.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了 奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.31,0:23:56.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.61,0:23:58.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也有变成普通人的时候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.88,0:23:59.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愚蠢…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.05,0:24:03.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为逃得出我奈落的掌心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.08,0:24:04.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.22,0:24:06.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像风一样自由自在的活着
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.05,0:24:08.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.02,0:24:11.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狂乱飞舞的背叛之风
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.29,0:24:12.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 我看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.06,0:24:14.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你人类的姿态
